{"id":425,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Said to lure away young children and carry them off to the afterlife. Some whisper that Drifloon are formed of reincarnated human souls, but these rumors are as yet unconfirmed."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The gathering of many souls gave rise to this Pokémon. During humid seasons, they seem to appear in abundance."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Perhaps seeking company, it approaches children. However, it often quickly runs away again when the children play too roughly with it."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Wandering souls gathered together to form this Pokémon. When trying to make friends with children, Drifloon grabs them by the hand."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Its round body is stuffed with souls and expands each time it leads someone away."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"If for some reason its body bursts, its soul spills out with a screaming sound."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Stories go that it grabs the hands of small children and drags them away to the afterlife. It dislikes heavy children."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"These Pokémon are called the “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.” Children holding them sometimes vanish."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Diamond"],"text":"A Pokémon formed by the spirits of people and Pokémon. It loves damp, humid seasons."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.”"},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It is whispered that any child who mistakes DRIFLOON for a balloon and holds on to it could wind up missing."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It tugs on the hands of children to steal them away. However, it gets pulled around instead."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Aftermath","hidden":false,"description":"Damages the attacker if it knocks out the Pokémon with a move that makes direct contact."},{"name":"Unburden","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Speed stat if the Pokémon's held item is used or lost."},{"name":"Flare Boost","hidden":true,"description":"Powers up special moves when the Pokémon is burned."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":30,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fluctuating","habitat":null,"color":"Purple","shape":"Arms","evolution":{"id":425,"name":"Drifloon","condition":null,"children":[{"id":426,"name":"Drifblim","condition":"Lv. 28","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,107],[1,310],[4,16],[8,116],[12,371],[16,506],[20,247],[24,254],[24,255],[24,256],[29,120],[32,194],[36,226],[40,366],[44,153]],"machine":[512,332,314,133,226,347,174,203,263,19,360,114,270,506,196,286,282,101,220,566,182,60,94,240,156,247,285,214,180,500,164,241,129,366,915,851,168,87,86,85,271,433,311,261],"egg":[499,432,50,114,95,262],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-136","name":"Drifloon","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"136","artist":"Whisker","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-136/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-136/large"},{"id":"me55-73","name":"Drifloon","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"73","artist":"Shinya Komatsu","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-73/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me55-73/large"},{"id":"sv7-60","name":"Drifloon","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Common","number":"60","artist":null,"img":"sv7/60"},{"id":"sv4pt5-155","name":"Drifloon","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Rare","number":"155","artist":"Kyoko Umemoto","img":"sv4pt5/155"},{"id":"sv1-89","name":"Drifloon","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Common","number":"89","artist":"Taira Akitsu","img":"sv1/89"},{"id":"swsh10-63","name":"Drifloon","set":"Astral Radiance","date":"2022-05-27","rarity":"Common","number":"63","artist":"Narumi Sato","img":"swsh10/63"},{"id